text.description:
The song as text: nested lists in parentheses, each starting with one of these words or a name the text gave (by def, defn, let, fn or for), with numbers, text in double quotes, :keywords, [lists] and {maps} between. Song words: song defsong section chords band drums bass riff vamp pad melody sing improvise canon dance lights wash heads spots lasers strobe fog house blackout ball derby burst ring scan at every bars with without named spell deck dj-set defset. Other words: def defn fn let do if when cond case and or not = not= < > <= >= + - * / inc dec mod quot max min odd? even? range repeat map mapv mapcat for concat into vec vector list conj cons first second last rest nth count take drop reverse cycle interleave partition apply str get assoc merge keyword name. Like:
(song {:title "Harbour Lights" :style :disco}
  (section :verse 8 (chords :am :f :c :g) (band)))
